    "text": "Details\nNot yet rated (0 reviews)\nLes Canus, Guernsey, Guernsey, GY2 4UL\nContact info\n07781 131605\ncstonebridge@cwgsy.net\nTreevolution Professional Tree Services\nFeatured\nTreevolution Professional Tree Services\nTreevolution Professional Tree Services\nTreevolution would like to wish everyone all the very best for 2021! We look forward to providing you with a professional service in the year ahead.\n\nJob opportunity:\n\nWe’re currently looking for a professional qualified arborist to join our team with good knowledge and climbing experience in the industry.\n\nThe role will offer a competitive package along with opportunities to progress further in your career. A professional manner, clean driving licence and sense of humour are essential!\n\nIf you are interested in the role please contact Chris 07781131605 or send your details via email to cstonebridge@cwgsy.net\n\nWe look forward to hearing from you!\n\nÀ la perchoine"
